  "2026-07-26T19:42:51.935Z","harness:codex","Evidence: package exports and files now publish ./sdk/public-surface.json from the canonical generated fixture. A fresh unrelated npm prefix resolved the packed artifact and SDK entrypoints without workspace links; schema v2 reported zero aggregate omissions. Linked package-boundary tests passed; full coverage and static gates are green."
